* {{IPAslink|b}} is {{IPAblink|b}} after nasals (e.g., {{IPA|bgj|mbé||}} {{gloss|nail}}) and {{IPAblink|p}} elsewhere (e.g., {{IPA|bgj|pà||}} {{gloss|bag}}).{{sfn|Njeck|2003a|pp=10-11}}
* {{IPAslink|d}} is {{IPAblink|d}} after nasals (e.g., {{IPA|bgj|ndɔ́ŋ||}} {{gloss|horn}}), {{IPAblink|l}}~{{IPAblink|ɾ}} between vowels or after syllable-final consonants (e.g., {{IPA|bgj|túŋlə̀||}}~{{IPA|bgj|túŋɾə̀||}} {{gloss|ear}}), and {{IPAblink|l}} elsewhere (e.g., {{IPA|bgj|lə̀ŋ||}} {{gloss|chair}}).{{sfn|Njeck|2003a|pp=10-11}}
* {{IPAslink|g}} is {{IPAblink|g}} after nasals (e.g., {{IPA|bgj|ŋgùt||}} {{gloss|skin}}) and {{IPAblink|ɣ}} elsewhere (e.g., {{IPA|bgj|ɣàtə́||}} {{gloss|divide}}).{{sfn|Njeck|2003a|pp=10-11}}
* {{IPAslink|t}} is {{IPAblink|tʰ}} before {{IPAblink|u}} in open syllables (e.g., {{IPA|bgj|tʰú||}} {{gloss|dig (verb)}}) and {{IPAblink|t}} elsewhere (e.g., {{IPA|bgj|túŋ||}} {{gloss|dig (verb)}}).{{sfn|Njeck|2003a|pp=10-11}}
* {{IPAslink|k}} is {{IPAblink|ʔ}} between vowels or syllable-finally (e.g., {{IPA|bgj|nàʔ||}} {{gloss|cow}}) and {{IPAblink|k}} elsewhere (e.g., {{IPA|bgj|kú||}} {{gloss|die (verb)}}).{{sfn|Njeck|2003a|pp=10-11}} 
* {{IPAslink|z}} is {{IPAblink|d͡ʒ}} in labialized or palatalized syllables after nasal consonants (e.g., {{IPA|bgj|nd͡ʒìŋ||}} {{gloss|darkness}}), {{IPAblink|ʒ}} in labialized or palatalized syllables (e.g., {{IPA|bgj|wǎʒwí||}} {{gloss|lion}}), {{IPAblink|d͡z}} after nasal consonants (e.g., {{IPA|bgj|nd͡zə̀||}} {{gloss|dream}}, and {{IPAblink|z}} elsewhere (e.g., {{IPA|bgj|zí||}} {{gloss|face}}).{{sfn|Njeck|2003a|p=11}}
* {{IPAslink|s}} is {{IPAblink|ʃ}} in labialized or palatalized syllables (e.g., {{IPA|bgj|ʃíʃí||}} {{gloss|vein}}) and {{IPAblink|s}} elsewhere (e.g., {{IPA|bgj|sáŋ||}} {{gloss|corn}}).{{sfn|Njeck|2003a|p=11}}
* {{IPAslink|t͡s}} is {{IPAblink|t͡ʃ}} in labialized or palatalized syllables (e.g., {{IPA|bgj|t͡ʃì||}} {{gloss|blood}}) and {{IPAblink|t͡s}} elsewhere (e.g., {{IPA|bgj|t͡sɔ̀t||}} {{gloss|mouth}}).{{sfn|Njeck|2003a|p=11}}
* {{IPA|/ʔ, t, ŋ/}} are the only syllable-final consonants.{{sfn|Njeck|2003a|p=16}}

